# ==============================================================================
# AI-Powered Google Review Assistance SaaS — Root Environment Reference
# ==============================================================================
# This workspace is a pnpm monorepo containing:
# - `apps/backend`: Fastify API server with PostgreSQL & Drizzle ORM
# - `apps/frontend`: React SPA for public customer QR landing and feedback flows
# - `packages/shared`: Shared TypeScript types, schemas, and error codes
#
# Refer to package-specific templates:
# - Backend configuration: apps/backend/.env.example
# - Frontend configuration: apps/frontend/.env.example
#
# Quickstart for local development:
# 1. Copy `apps/backend/.env.example` to `apps/backend/.env`
# 2. Start dev servers: pnpm dev
# ==============================================================================
